1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,632
Split the slit into four strips instead, and pair neighbouring strips: darkness again when a sine theta is two lambda.

2
00:00:08,632 --> 00:00:11,171
Six strips give three lambda.

3
00:00:11,171 --> 00:00:19,622
So the minima are at a sine theta equals n lambda, for n equal to plus or minus one, two, three.

